{"seq":3,"slug":"reactivity-models","title":"响应式模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/state-management-patterns/fundamentals/reactivity-models","wordCount":923,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"响应式模型\">响应式模型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>响应式是状态变化时自动更新相关依赖的机制，是现代前端框架的核心。不同框架采用不同的响应式模型：React 使用虚拟 DOM diff，Vue 使用基于 Proxy 的依赖追踪，Signals 使用细粒度订阅。理解这些差异有助于选择合适的技术栈和优化策略。每种模型在性能特征、心智模型和调试体验上都有显著差异。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[状态变化] --&gt; B{响应式模型}&#10;    B --&gt; C[Pull 模型&lt;br/&gt;React]&#10;    B --&gt; D[Push 模型&lt;br/&gt;Vue/MobX]&#10;    B --&gt; E[Signals&lt;br/&gt;Preact/Solid]&#10;    C --&gt; F[虚拟 DOM Diff]&#10;    D --&gt; G[依赖追踪 + 精确更新]&#10;    E --&gt; H[细粒度订阅]\">graph LR\n    A[状态变化] --&gt; B{响应式模型}\n    B --&gt; C[Pull 模型&lt;br/&gt;React]\n    B --&gt; D[Push 模型&lt;br/&gt;Vue/MobX]\n    B --&gt; E[Signals&lt;br/&gt;Preact/Solid]\n    C --&gt; F[虚拟 DOM Diff]\n    D --&gt; G[依赖追踪 + 精确更新]\n    E --&gt; H[细粒度订阅]</pre><h2 id=\"响应式的基本思想\">响应式的基本思想</h2><h3 id=\"问题-手动更新\">问题：手动更新</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 手动更新，容易出错&#10;let count = 0;&#10;let double = count * 2;&#10;&#10;count = 1;&#10;// double 不会自动更新！仍然是 0&#10;console.log(double); // 0，不对！\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 手动更新，容易出错</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> double </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// double 不会自动更新！仍然是 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(double); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 0，不对！</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"解决-响应式\">解决：响应式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 响应式，自动更新&#10;const count = ref(0);&#10;const double = computed(() =&gt; count.value * 2);&#10;&#10;count.value = 1;&#10;// double 自动更新为 2&#10;console.log(double.value); // 2，正确！\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 响应式，自动更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> double</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> computed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count.value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">count.value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// double 自动更新为 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(double.value); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2，正确！</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"常见响应式模型\">常见响应式模型</h2><h3 id=\"1-推送模型-push-based\">1. 推送模型 (Push-based)</h3><p><strong>核心思想</strong>: 状态变化时，主动推送通知给依赖。</p>\n<p><strong>代表</strong>: MobX, Vue 2/3, Solid.js</p>\n<p><strong>工作原理</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 Proxy (Vue 3) 或 Object.defineProperty (Vue 2)</li>\n<li>拦截属性的 get/set</li>\n<li>get 时收集依赖</li>\n<li>set 时通知依赖更新</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 (Vue 3)</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { reactive, computed } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const state = reactive({&#10;  count: 0,&#10;});&#10;&#10;const double = computed(() =&gt; state.count * 2);&#10;&#10;// 修改 count&#10;state.count = 1;&#10;// double 自动更新&#10;console.log(double.value); // 2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { reactive, computed } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  count: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> double</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> computed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> state.count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 修改 count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">state.count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// double 自动更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(double.value); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>优点</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>精确更新（只更新变化的）</li>\n<li>性能通常很好</li>\n<li>代码简洁</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>缺点</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>实现复杂</li>\n<li>调试可能困难</li>\n<li>可能有内存泄漏（如果不清理依赖）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2-拉取模型-pull-based\">2. 拉取模型 (Pull-based)</h3><p><strong>核心思想</strong>: 需要时才检查是否变化，重新渲染。</p>\n<p><strong>代表</strong>: React</p>\n<p><strong>工作原理</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>状态变化时，标记组件为脏</li>\n<li>下次渲染时，重新执行组件函数</li>\n<li>比较新旧虚拟 DOM，更新真实 DOM</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 (React)</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { useState, useMemo } from &#39;react&#39;&#10;&#10;function Counter() {&#10;  const [count, setCount] = useState(0)&#10;  const double = useMemo(() =&gt; count * 2, [count])&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;p&gt;{double}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;      &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; setCount(c =&gt; c + 1)}&gt;&#10;        Increment&#10;      &lt;/button&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { useState, useMemo } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Counter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">setCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> double</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useMemo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [count])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>{double}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">button onClick</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{() => </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        Increment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">button</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">div</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>优点</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>实现简单</li>\n<li>可预测性好</li>\n<li>调试容易</li>\n<li>时间旅行调试容易</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>缺点</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>可能重新渲染不需要的组件</li>\n<li>需要手动优化（memo, useMemo, useCallback）</li>\n<li>大量组件时可能性能问题</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"3-信号模型-signals\">3. 信号模型 (Signals)</h3><p><strong>核心思想</strong>: 细粒度的响应式原语，结合推送和拉取的优点。</p>\n<p><strong>代表</strong>: Preact Signals, Solid.js, Angular Signals, Qwik</p>\n<p><strong>工作原理</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>信号是可观察的值容器</li>\n<li>自动追踪依赖</li>\n<li>精确更新</li>\n<li>可以在组件外使用</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 (Preact Signals)</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { signal, computed } from &#39;@preact/signals&#39;&#10;&#10;const count = signal(0)&#10;const double = computed(() =&gt; count.value * 2)&#10;&#10;// 在组件中使用&#10;function Counter() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;p&gt;{double}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;      &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; count.value++}&gt;&#10;        Increment&#10;      &lt;/button&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { signal, computed } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@preact/signals'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> signal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> double</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> computed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count.value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 在组件中使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Counter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>{double}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">button onClick</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{() => count.value++}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        Increment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">button</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">div</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>优点</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>性能极佳</li>\n<li>精确更新</li>\n<li>灵活（可在组件外使用）</li>\n<li>简洁的 API</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>缺点</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>相对较新</li>\n<li>生态还在发展</li>\n<li>学习新的概念</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"响应式模型对比\">响应式模型对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n<th>更新方式</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>学习曲线</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>推送</td>\n<td>MobX, Vue</td>\n<td>精确推送</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拉取</td>\n<td>React</td>\n<td>重新渲染</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐</td>\n<td>⭐⭐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信号</td>\n<td>Solid, Preact</td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实际应用\">实际应用</h2><h3 id=\"选择响应式模型的考虑\">选择响应式模型的考虑</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>考虑因素</th>\n<th>偏好</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>性能要求极高</td>\n<td>信号 &gt; 推送 &gt; 拉取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>团队熟悉度</td>\n<td>选择团队熟悉的</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态系统</td>\n<td>React 生态丰富</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>项目大小</td>\n<td>小项目可以简单，大项目需要好的架构</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"性能优化\">性能优化</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>优化方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>React</td>\n<td><code>memo</code>, <code>useMemo</code>, <code>useCallback</code>, 状态提升/下推</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vue</td>\n<td><code>computed</code>, <code>shallowRef</code>, <code>markRaw</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MobX</td>\n<td><code>observer</code>, <code>computed</code>, 合理组织 store</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信号</td>\n<td>通常不需要优化，自动处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((响应式模型))&#10;    Pull 模型&#10;      React setState&#10;      虚拟 DOM Diff&#10;      需要手动优化&#10;    Push 模型&#10;      Vue Proxy&#10;      MobX Observable&#10;      自动依赖收集&#10;    Signals&#10;      Preact Signals&#10;      Solid.js&#10;      细粒度订阅&#10;    优化策略&#10;      memo / useMemo&#10;      computed&#10;      shallowRef\">mindmap\n  root((响应式模型))\n    Pull 模型\n      React setState\n      虚拟 DOM Diff\n      需要手动优化\n    Push 模型\n      Vue Proxy\n      MobX Observable\n      自动依赖收集\n    Signals\n      Preact Signals\n      Solid.js\n      细粒度订阅\n    优化策略\n      memo / useMemo\n      computed\n      shallowRef</pre><ul>\n<li>不同响应式模型有不同的性能特点和优化策略</li>\n<li>React 的 Pull 模型需要更多手动优化（memo、useMemo）</li>\n<li>Vue/MobX 的 Push 模型自动追踪依赖，优化更简单</li>\n<li>Signals 是最新趋势，性能最优但生态较小</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>核心要点回顾：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>响应式自动更新依赖</li>\n<li>三种常见模型：推送、拉取、信号</li>\n<li>React 是拉取模型，Vue/MobX 是推送模型</li>\n<li>信号是新兴的、高性能的选择</li>\n<li>根据项目需求和团队选择</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"附录-响应式模型演进\">附录：响应式模型演进</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[手动 DOM 操作&lt;br/&gt;jQuery] --&gt; B[脏检查&lt;br/&gt;AngularJS]&#10;    B --&gt; C[虚拟 DOM&lt;br/&gt;React 2013]&#10;    B --&gt; D[依赖追踪&lt;br/&gt;Vue 2014]&#10;    C --&gt; E[并发模式&lt;br/&gt;React 18]&#10;    D --&gt; F[Proxy 响应式&lt;br/&gt;Vue 3]&#10;    E --&gt; G[Signals&lt;br/&gt;2022+]&#10;    F --&gt; G\">graph LR\n    A[手动 DOM 操作&lt;br/&gt;jQuery] --&gt; B[脏检查&lt;br/&gt;AngularJS]\n    B --&gt; C[虚拟 DOM&lt;br/&gt;React 2013]\n    B --&gt; D[依赖追踪&lt;br/&gt;Vue 2014]\n    C --&gt; E[并发模式&lt;br/&gt;React 18]\n    D --&gt; F[Proxy 响应式&lt;br/&gt;Vue 3]\n    E --&gt; G[Signals&lt;br/&gt;2022+]\n    F --&gt; G</pre><p>从 jQuery 的手动 DOM 操作到 AngularJS 的脏检查，再到 React 虚拟 DOM 和 Vue 的 Proxy 响应式，前端响应式模型经历了多次范式转移。Signals 代表了当前的演进方向——它结合了 Push 模型的精确更新和 Pull 模型的可预测性，正在被 Angular、Preact、Solid 等多个框架采纳。选择响应式模型时，团队熟悉度和生态成熟度往往比理论性能更重要。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"响应式模型","id":"响应式模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"响应式的基本思想","id":"响应式的基本思想"},{"level":3,"text":"问题：手动更新","id":"问题-手动更新"},{"level":3,"text":"解决：响应式","id":"解决-响应式"},{"level":2,"text":"常见响应式模型","id":"常见响应式模型"},{"level":3,"text":"1. 推送模型 (Push-based)","id":"1-推送模型-push-based"},{"level":3,"text":"2. 拉取模型 (Pull-based)","id":"2-拉取模型-pull-based"},{"level":3,"text":"3. 信号模型 (Signals)","id":"3-信号模型-signals"},{"level":2,"text":"响应式模型对比","id":"响应式模型对比"},{"level":2,"text":"实际应用","id":"实际应用"},{"level":3,"text":"选择响应式模型的考虑","id":"选择响应式模型的考虑"},{"level":3,"text":"性能优化","id":"性能优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"附录：响应式模型演进","id":"附录-响应式模型演进"}],"prev":{"title":"状态分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/state-management-patterns/fundamentals/state-categories"},"next":{"title":"不可变 vs 可变","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/state-management-patterns/fundamentals/immutability-vs-mutability"}}